    {"no": 33, "type": "panel", "desc": "실무 대화 — 위 1컷 + 아래 2분할", "width": 100, "ratio": "16:9", "shape": "box", "spacing": {"before": 0, "after": 96}, "mood": "night", "lines": [{"who": "해인", "text": "옮기면 다시 다 맞춰야 해서요.", "style": "speech", "at": "in-tl", "panel": 0}, {"who": "해인", "text": "첫 곡은 그대로 틀기만 하면 돼요.", "style": "speech", "at": "in-tl", "panel": 0}, {"who": "승민", "text": "그 뒤에 반복할 곡은요?", "style": "speech", "at": "in-tl", "panel": 1}, {"who": "해인", "text": "그건 컴퓨터로 옮겨도 돼요.", "style": "speech", "at": "in-tl", "panel": 2}, {"who": "해인", "text": "시작이랑 음량만 맞춰 주세요.", "style": "speech", "at": "in-br", "panel": 2, "hideName": true}], "bubbleNote": "각 조각 **안쪽**에만 둔다(사선 경계를 가로지르지 않음). 말풍선 하나에 최대 2줄. 읽는 순서는 위 → 아래 왼쪽 → 아래 오른쪽.", "image": null, "rows": [[{"ratio": "16:9", "image": "ep01v3-033-a-DRAFT.webp", "imageSize": {"w": 1080, "h": 608}, "imageStatus": "draft", "imageLqip": "data:image/webp;base64,UklGRq4AAABXRUJQVlA4IKIAAADwBACdASoYAA4APt1cpkyopSOiMAgBEBuJQBWATYEqB7wzy6Ioq7M3TICm7U/5YAAA/ujxZXL8iiQeEpUIEFVsGdC0VC0sghrAWm1TWvFWBav35OcvBZnGtpE5i7DIpMi5UScfeXIGjS8QEIJj21gDqblxyfjXuGiRimpXOH8rVhN+i/eVyT1lb7MHjmlG+nVOaY9JiqPnlDJOflUdoTaIAAA="}], [{"ratio": "1:1", "image": "ep01v3-033-b-DRAFT.webp", "imageSize": {"w": 1080, "h": 1080}, "imageStatus": "draft", "imageLqip": "data:image/webp;base64,UklGRqoAAABXRUJQVlA4IJ4AAABwBQCdASoYABgAPt1qrlEopiQiqAgBEBuJQBWGaOaMAlCnXwfdTpUyia10meupzz8HvWOAAP5T8rx7VmwJitiNod985rQLE+MvhjoIl3kJHGpmWv0saOGXjsL4i8mGmoeRKG2rvCY1x3ynOi1mQXy04VhY/L6RdE0QnLPRBWNttd6PeR2YSU2ztJqVbBawd1LxnW76Qk1jWBbKO9AQAA=="}, {"ratio": "1:1", "image": "ep01v3-033-c-DRAFT.webp", "imageSize": {"w": 1080, "h": 1080}, "imageStatus": "draft", "imageLqip": "data:image/webp;base64,UklGRrYAAABXRUJQVlA4IKoAAAAwBQCdASoYABgAPt1gp04opaMiKA1REBuJQBZwAiOT7aRgzRvyV55MZANByz+rmQUi4AD+2Oe48kkInb7ShXGPKKlGYy9cJ3Wa3pyr1nbVwqcbbpuTuFmEtIfUOVwpheVfDSx4QwCAcEvZRpvycPpOr38S5oAE5Zz+ulGcumY/JZt4lVHxZHue58A3sSNTvkIAtHLDUxWJMZ8QYQ1RJMVTu39VMAQUH8AAAA=="}]], "rowGap": 8, "diagonal": true}